{"sections":{"cd6f0aa5-3e50-4e14-9442-f70cf3cc6bfd":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--18842141524243__cd6f0aa5-3e50-4e14-9442-f70cf3cc6bfd-16832294185b657b5e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Inclusive Luxury","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--18842141524243__cd6f0aa5-3e50-4e14-9442-f70cf3cc6bfd-16832294185b657b5e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Born and based in New York City, Tresi offers eclectic, luxury pre-loved furniture, decor, and art without the retail markup. We believe interior design should be inclusive—your home should reflect your style without breaking the bank (or breaking next year).<\/p><p>Whether you're just starting your design journey or looking for a one-stop shop, we’ve got you covered. We only sell what we’d want in our own homes and curate so you don’t have to.<\/p><p>To make furnishing your home as easy as possible, we provide transparent pricing, door-to-door convenience, and dedicated customer service. Currently serving Manhattan, Brooklyn, Jersey City, and parts of Queens.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--18842141524243__cd6f0aa5-3e50-4e14-9442-f70cf3cc6bfd-16832294185b657b5e-0","template--18842141524243__cd6f0aa5-3e50-4e14-9442-f70cf3cc6bfd-16832294185b657b5e-1"],"custom_css":["@media screen and (min-width: 750px) {h2 {margin-top: -3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; } p {margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }}","@media screen and (max-width: 750px) {.image-with-text__heading {margin-top: 20px; } p {margin-bottom: 2rem; }}"],"settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/campaign-28_b6076dfd-096b-49c7-9d6e-e4d5132b80a0.jpg","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/campaign-18.jpg","desktop_height":50,"mobile_height":44,"height":"small","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","desktop_display_type":"block","show_social_media":"none","tiktok_url":"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/","instagram_url":"https:\/\/www.